Template: d9-tmux/color-scheme-hue
Type: select
Choices: 210 (blue), 120 (green), 0 (red), 180 (cyan), 270 (purple), 30 (orange), 60 (yellow), 300 (magenta)
Default: 210 (blue)
Description: tmux color scheme hue
 Choose the base hue for your tmux color scheme (HSL hue value).
 The system will automatically generate a harmonious color scheme
 based on this hue value.
